WEBVTT

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:01.917
at which every dish included potatoes.

00:02:03.083 --> 00:02:05.500
And Franklin was a guest of honor.

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:08.143
Even the king and queen of France

00:02:08.167 --> 00:02:12.309
were persuaded to wear potatoes,

00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:13.976
potato flowers, pardon me.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.268
(Laughter)

00:02:15.292 --> 00:02:19.768
The king wore a potato
flower in his lapel,

00:02:19.792 --> 00:02:23.768
and the queen wore
a potato flower in her hair.

00:02:23.792 --> 00:02:27.643
That was a truly great
public relations idea.

00:02:27.667 --> 00:02:29.476
But there was a catch.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:33.059
The potato was too efficient
for Europe's good.